# SPA fallback for Cloudflare Pages / Netlify.
#
# TanStack Router does client-side routing, so every unknown URL must
# fall through to index.html and let React take over. Without this rule,
# /download, /profile, /bookings/xyz etc. all 404 on refresh or direct-
# link.
#
# The `!` on the second column of the first line would exempt some paths
# if we needed to; we don't — every path is a React route.
/*    /index.html   200
